			<ul class="unstyled" style="text-indent:-1em; margin-left:1em; margin-bottom:5px">
				<li><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma</li>
				<li><strong>Feat:</strong> Skilled</li>
				<li><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Investigation and History</li>
				<li><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Calligrapher's Supplies</li>
				<li><strong>Equipment:</strong><i> Choose A or B:</i> (A) Book, Ink and Ink Pen, Parchment (10 sheets), Traveler's Clothes, 20 GP; or (B) 50 GP</li>
			</ul>
			<p>You grew up in the shadow of a school, university, or scholarly institution — not necessarily as a student, but surrounded by the debates, texts, and rivalries of people who thought for a living.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="short">Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma, Skilled Feat, Investigation and History Skills, Calligrapher's Supplies</set>
